+  "content": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);line-height:1.5\">Calls for proposals, grants, tenders and expressions of interest relevant to organisations working in Bangladesh. Every listing shows the funder, size, deadline and status, and links to the original notice.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Open now</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px\">Last checked: 15 November 2026.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Opportunity</th><th>Funder</th><th>Size</th><th>Deadline</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.undp.org/press-releases/innovators-wanted-undp-launches-usd-1-million-global-challenge-healthier-ocean\">Ocean Innovation Challenge, 5th call: marine pollution, coastal restoration and the blue economy</a><br><small>Private-sector innovators; solutions that benefit Bangladesh, Indonesia, the Philippines, Thailand or Viet Nam get priority. Women-led and youth-led ideas preferred.</small></td><td>UNDP, funded by Sida</td><td>Up to USD 100,000 each (up to 10 awards)</td><td>15 Nov 2026, 23:59 New York time</td><td><strong>CLOSING SOON</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/2026/10/29/open-call-global-eba-fund-medium-size-grants-of-up-to-500000-for-ecosystem-based-adaptation/\">Medium-size grants for ecosystem-based adaptation</a></td><td>Global EbA Fund (IUCN, UNEP; IKI funding)</td><td>Up to USD 500,000</td><td>16 Nov 2026</td><td><strong>CLOSING SOON</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://www.yves-rocher-fondation.org/en/how-to-apply-for-the-international-award/\">Terre de Femmes International Award 2027: \"Trees in the City\"</a><br><small>Open worldwide. Projects led by a woman or group of women, run through a non-profit at least one year old.</small></td><td>Yves Rocher Foundation</td><td>EUR 10,000 each (2 winners)</td><td>30 Nov 2026</td><td><strong>OPEN</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recently closed</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Opportunity</th><th>Funder</th><th>Deadline</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Small-size grants for ecosystem-based adaptation</td><td>Global EbA Fund</td><td>26 Oct 2026</td><td>CLOSED</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://asiapacific.unwomen.org/en/programme-implementation/2026/09/unw-ap-bgd-cfp-2026-003-addressing-the-medium-to-long-term-reintegration-needs-and-strengthening-social-protection-support-mechanisms-for-the-social-inclusion-of-bangladeshi-migrants\">Reintegration and social protection for Bangladeshi women migrants (CSO partner)</a></td><td>UN Women Bangladesh</td><td>15 Oct 2026</td><td>CLOSED</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we list opportunities</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>We link to the funder&#8217;s own notice wherever one exists.</li>\n\n\n<li>Status labels are OPEN, CLOSING SOON (seven days or less), UPCOMING and CLOSED. We never describe an expired call as open.</li>\n\n\n<li>Each listing shows the date we last checked it. Deadlines can change, so always confirm with the funder.</li>\n\n\n<li>Featured placement may be paid for in future. Paid listings will always be labelled and will never change a listing&#8217;s status or details.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Funding Tracker</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are building a tracker of who funds what in Bangladesh: major donors, thematic priorities, humanitarian and development financing, climate finance and localisation. Read our first funding analysis on the <a href=\"/2026/10/29/rohingya-response-the-2026-appeal-is-a-quarter-smaller-and-still-underfunded/\">Rohingya response appeal</a> and the <a href=\"/2026/10/29/new-atlantic-council-brief-examines-bangladeshs-changing-aid-landscape/\">changing aid landscape</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/submit/\">Submit a funding opportunity</a> · <a href=\"/category/funding/\">All funding coverage</a></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px\">Top image: the Sundarbans mangrove forest. Photo: Amdadphoto / <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mangrove_River_Maze.jpg\">Wikimedia Commons</a>, <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>.</p>\n\n\n",
